# Deep-Guard Fix — 2026-07-10T20:05:57+03:30
# File: /tmp/dvna/core/appHandler.js  Line: 197  Severity: critical
# Type: path_traversal

## Root Cause
The use of 'mathjs.eval' allows for the execution of untrusted user input, which leads to potential execution of arbitrary code through path traversal and other injection attacks.

## Explanation
The patch replaces 'mathjs.eval' with a safer alternative that parses and evaluates mathematical expressions without executing general JavaScript code. This prevents attackers from injecting harmful payloads, ensuring that only valid mathematical operations are performed.

## Patch
